## Transfer Fields

<table>
    <tr>
        <th>Field</th>
        <th>Type</th>
        <th>Required</th>
        <th>Description</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td>type</td>
        <td>integer</td> 
        <td>yes</td>
        <td>Type of Transfer.<br>0 - additional<br>1 - arrival<br>2 - departure</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td>pickup_type</td>
        <td>string</td>
        <td>yes</td>
        <td>Valid location type: location, school or accommodation</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td>pickup_location</td>
        <td>string</td> 
        <td>yes</td>
        <td>- must be 0 if pickup_type is accommodation<br>- must be 1 if pickup_type is school<br>- must be a valid location id > 1 if pickup_type is location</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td>date</td>
        <td>string</td>
        <td>yes</td>
        <td>Date of the transfer, format: YYYY-MM-DD</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td>time</td>
        <td>string</td>
        <td>yes</td>
        <td>Time of the transfer, format: HH-MM-SS</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td>dropoff_type</td>
        <td>string</td>
        <td>yes</td>
        <td>Valid location type: location, school or accommodation</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td>dropoff_location</td>
        <td>string</td> 
        <td>yes</td>
        <td>- must be 0 if dropoff_type is accommodation<br>- must be 1 if dropoff_type is school<br>- must be a valid location id > 1 if dropoff_type is location</td>
    </tr>
</table>

