# Group Booking

## Create a booking [/bookings]

### Create a booking [POST]

+ Request

    + Header
    
            Authorization: Bearer access_token

+ Request (application/json)

            {
              "inbox": "default",
              "school_id": 1,
              "firstname": "API2",
              "lastname": "Test",
              "birthday": "1990-01-01",
              "gender": 1,
              "phone_private": "+49213112345",
              "email": "test2@test.de",
              "nationality": "DE",
              "language": "de",
              "corresponding_language": "de",
              "comment": "Test comment",
              "comment_course_category": "Comment",
              "referrer_id": 5,
              "student_status_id": 1,
              "courses" : [
                {
                  "course_id": 4,
                  "language_id": 5,
                  "level_id": 1,
                  "weeks": 10,
                  "from": "2025-02-16",
                  "until": "2025-05-31"
                },
                {
                  "course_id": 77,
                  "language_id": 5,
                  "level_id": 1,
                  "weeks": 10,
                  "from": "2025-02-16",
                  "until": "2025-05-31"
                }
              ],
              "accommodations": [
                {
                  "accommodation_id": 31,
                  "weeks": 10,
                  "from": "2025-02-16",
                  "until": "2025-05-31"
                }
              ],
              "activities": [
                {
                  "activity_id": 1,
                  "weeks": 10,
                  "from": "2025-02-16",
                  "until": "2025-05-31"
                },
                {
                  "activity_id": 6,
                  "weeks": 10,
                  "from": "2025-02-16",
                  "until": "2025-05-31"
                }
              ],
              "insurances": [
                {
                  "insurance_id": 1,
                  "weeks": 10,
                  "from": "2025-02-16",
                  "until": "2025-05-31"
                },
                {
                  "insurance_id": 2,
                  "weeks": 10,
                  "from": "2025-02-16",
                  "until": "2025-05-31"
                }
              ],
              "transfers": [
                {
                  "type": 1,
                  "pickup_type": "location",
                  "pickup_location": 19,
                  "date": "2025-05-31",
                  "time": "11:00:00",
                  "dropoff_type": "location",
                  "dropoff_location": 4
                },
                {
                  "type": 2,
                  "pickup_type": "location",
                  "pickup_location": 19,
                  "date": "2025-05-31",
                  "time": "11:00:00",
                  "dropoff_type": "location",
                  "dropoff_location": 4
                },
                {
                  "type": 0,
                  "pickup_type": "location",
                  "pickup_location": 19,
                  "date": "2025-02-26",
                  "time": "11:00:00",
                  "dropoff_type": "location",
                  "dropoff_location": 4
                }
              ],
              "custom_fields": {
                    "221": "Text"
                }
            }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    The entity has been created successfully. For further updates you can find the corresponding ID for this entity in the response.
    
    It can take a moment for the enquiry to show up in the software.
    
    + Body
    
            {
                "id": 123,
                "status": 200,
                "message": "Entry successfully created"
            }


+ Response 400 (application/json)

    The validation of your input data has failed. The entity was not created. You can find the issues in the response JSON.

    + Body

            {
                "errors": [
                    {
                        "field": "referrer_id",
                        "code": "INVALID_VALUE",
                        "message": "Field referrer id has invalid value: 666"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "birthday",
                        "code": "INVALID_DATE",
                        "message": "Field birthday has invalid date format: 1990-01-01x"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "corresponding_language",
                        "code": "REQUIRED_FIELD_MISSING",
                        "message": "Field is required: corresponding language"
                    },
                    {
                        "field": "custom_fields.124",
                        "code": "INVALID_VALUE",
